{"name":"南门天下·蒙羊世家烀羊专家(公兴路店)","brand_group":null,"brand_confirmed":false,"cuisine_paths":[["中餐","京菜","涮羊肉铜锅"]],"form":"Casual Dining","meals":["午餐","晚餐"],"ingredients":["火锅锅物","肉禽"],"awards":{"michelin":"无","black_pearl":0,"source_url":null},"special_tags":[],"price_avg":130,"price_range":"¥100-180","price_sources":[{"platform":"Trip.com","value":130,"url":"https://hk.trip.com/restaurant/china/shanghai/detail/restaurant-135991341/"}],"district":"静安区","address":"公兴路6号1层","business_area":"四川北路","lat":null,"lng":null,"coord_source":null,"phone_raw":"021-56380799","booking_method":"大众点评","signature_dishes":["明档现切羊肉","烀羊","麻酱调料","韭花酱"],"status":"open","scores":{"objective":75,"diner":78,"taste":78,"endorsement":45,"soft_ad_penalty":3,"platform_credibility":0.85},"evidence":{"diner_quotes":[{"quote":"明档现切的羊肉片薄厚均匀，肉质上乘入口鲜嫩且毫无膻味。麻酱和韭花调料十分地道，让人在上海也能品尝到正宗老北京涮肉的醇厚风味。服务员很勤快还仔细介绍。","dish":"明档现切羊肉","source":"Trip.com","url":"https://hk.trip.com/restaurant/china/shanghai/detail/restaurant-135991341/","date":"2025-10-25"},{"quote":"现切鲜羊肉是立盘不倒品质的保障，再来一盘精品羊羔肉和极品肥牛。好的肉基本上烫一下肉香味就已经出来了，再深深的裹上这一口麻酱，这还去什么北京？","dish":"现切鲜羊肉","source":"抖音","url":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7277163164662271287","date":"2023-09-10"}],"platform_scores":[{"platform":"Trip.com","score":4.8,"review_count":20,"url":"https://hk.trip.com/restaurant/china/shanghai/detail/restaurant-135991341/"}],"negative_signals":["评论样本少","新开店"],"soft_ad_flags":[],"traffic_signals":["明档现切吸引客流"]},"sources":[{"title":"Trip.com-南门天下蒙羊世家","url":"https://hk.trip.com/restaurant/china/shanghai/detail/restaurant-135991341/","type":"platform"},{"title":"荟集生活-蒙羊世家铁锅烀羊肉公兴路店","url":"https://www.huijimall.com/detail.html?goodsId=42098","type":"brand_official"}],"data_updated_at":"2026-09-23","notes":"地址补全：公兴路6号（高德/Trip.com/360地图/荟集生活/城市吧交叉核实）。电话021-56380799。蒙羊世家品牌，与南门涮肉不同。补抖音第二条堂食点评含立盘不倒/精品羊羔肉/极品肥牛具体菜名。"}
